      "Abstract": {
        "CopyrightInformation": "Copyright 2004 Wiley-Liss, Inc.",
        "AbstractText": "The experience of brachytherapy in the treatment of in-stent restenosis of allograft arteries is limited. We present two cases of in-stent restenosis treated with brachytherapy with favorable angiographic follow-up at 10 months in one patient and at 17 months in the other."
      },
